### SlotGuard Booking API — VS Code REST Client / IntelliJ HTTP Requests
@baseUrl = http://localhost:8102
@memberEmail = member@slotguard.dev
@memberPassword = Member@1234
@ownerEmail = owner@slotguard.dev
@ownerPassword = Owner@1234

### 1. Health Probe
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/health

### 2. Member Login (captures JWT access_token)
# @name memberLogin
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "email": "{{memberEmail}}",
  "password": "{{memberPassword}}"
}

###
@memberToken = {{memberLogin.response.body.$.access_token}}

### 3. List Bookable Resources
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/resources

### 4. Inspect Daily Slot Availability (Half-Open UTC Windows)
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/resources/1/availability?date=2026-12-10

### 5. Reserve Time Slot [14:00, 15:00) UTC (15-min HOLD)
# @name createBooking
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/bookings
Authorization: Bearer {{memberToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "resource_id": 1,
  "start_time": "2026-12-10T14:00:00Z",
  "end_time": "2026-12-10T15:00:00Z"
}

###
@bookingId = {{createBooking.response.body.$.id}}

### 6. Overlapping Double-Booking Conflict Guard (409 Conflict Expected)
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/bookings
Authorization: Bearer {{memberToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "resource_id": 1,
  "start_time": "2026-12-10T14:30:00Z",
  "end_time": "2026-12-10T15:30:00Z"
}

### 7. Owner Login (ROLE OWNER)
# @name ownerLogin
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "email": "{{ownerEmail}}",
  "password": "{{ownerPassword}}"
}

###
@ownerToken = {{ownerLogin.response.body.$.access_token}}

### 8. Owner Creates a New Bookable Studio Resource
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/resources
Authorization: Bearer {{ownerToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "Podcast Room B",
  "resource_type": "STUDIO",
  "description": "Soundproof studio equipped with dual XLR mics",
  "capacity": 4,
  "hourly_rate_cents": 3500,
  "open_time": "08:00:00",
  "close_time": "20:00:00",
  "slot_duration_minutes": 60
}

### 9. Cancel Active HOLD Booking
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/bookings/{{bookingId}}/cancel
Authorization: Bearer {{memberToken}}
